00:44:06,640 --> 00:44:13,640
Her parents, a bit old fashioned, tend to overreact to her nose ring, the music she listens to and the length of her skirts.

400
00:44:13,640 --> 00:44:17,640
They ground her a few times and she seethes inside.

401
00:44:17,640 --> 00:44:21,640
I hate you, she screams at her father after an argument.

402
00:44:21,640 --> 00:44:25,640
That night, she acts on a plan she's rehearsed many times.

403
00:44:25,640 --> 00:44:26,640
She runs away.

404
00:44:26,640 --> 00:44:31,640
She has visited Detroit only once before on a church youth group trip.

